  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      187.13,
      197.06,
      405.37,
      209.54
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 2.00 p.m. on 15 November 2026",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      213.59,
      534.05,
      439.87
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area located to the East of Sri Lanka, in the Bay of Bengal, has developed into a \u2018Depression. The system was located approximately 630 km northeast of Trincomalee, slightly East of the Northeast direction by 11:30 a.m. today. It is highly likely that the system will continue to move away from Sri Lanka and intensify into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 by the evening of tomorrow (November 16) over the southern and adjacent west-central Bay of Bengal, and further intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17. Due to the influence of this system, cloudy skies will prevail over the entire island tomorrow. Several spells of showers will occur in the Northern, North-central, Eastern, Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in the Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      443.65,
      534.04,
      483.43
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur a few places in the Uva province and Hambantota district after 2.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      493.18,
      502.55,
      526.99
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      530.65,
      488.45,
      553.63
